  "instructions": [
    "In a stockpot or 5-quart dutch oven , heat the oil over moderate heat",
    "Add the onion , green pepper , and garlic",
    "Saut until soft",
    "Stir in tomatoes and juice , chicken stock , water , rice , and basil",
    "Bring to a boil",
    "Simmer gently , covered , for 10 minutes",
    "Add carrots and cook about 5 minutes",
    "Add chicken , green beans , and olives",
